==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|ru}} {{term|Коминтерн|tr=Komintérn|lang=ru}}, contracted abbreviation of  {{term|Коммунистический интернационал||tr=Kommunístíčeskij internacionál|Communist International|lang=ru}}, from {{term|коммунистический|lang=ru}} + {{term|интернационал|lang=ru}}.

===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-proper noun}}
# An [[international]] [[association]] of [[Communist]] [[parties]], established in 1919 by Lenin.

